,"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n- Reproductible in v4.7 latest commit 40448082abe972daa179c64d7889cd88a8e7ea9c\n- Reproductible in v4.7.dev.custom_build [2363720b5]\n- Not reproductible in 4.6\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.dev (2363720b5) - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3080 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.9174) - 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i9-12900K (24 threads) - 63.78 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nThere is an issue with saving a GDScript. The file is not written to the disk and not marked as dirty in the editor.\nThis only seems to happen if the script has a \"compilation\" issue before editing.\nSometime a second Ctrl+S correctly save the script but sometime it's seems you are just editing a ghost clone and can't never save the script.\n\nIf the script is in a not compiling state we can't save the file until the Editor say that the script is valid.\n\nI used git bisect and this issue seems caused by #114917 but it's a big PR, not sure in that where the problem is.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n### Case 1 saving a valid script too quickly that was invalid before\n- Open the file `invalid_script.gd` in MRP\n- Select the following text on line 8 `var test = `\n- Delete the selected text\n- Quickly press Ctrl+S before the red line of the error goes away\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1b338867-7685-4729-ae0d-2ec37cbd3f91)\n\n### Case 2 saving a invalid script that was already invalid before\n- Open the file `invalid_script.gd` in MRP\n- Add anything to the script\n- Press Ctrl+S\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6bf5623f-16e5-4629-88fe-cbe92d5669d1)\n\nSee that both time the script was not saved to the disk and not marked as dirty (*)\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[mrp_script_edit_2026-02-11_22-03-08.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25244368/mrp_script_edit_2026-02-11_22-03-08.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116183/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116183/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}